        rdfs:comment        "Lyon, musée historique des Tissus. Soieries sassanides, coptes et byzantines, Ve-XIe sièclesByzantine Silk Weaving AD 400 to AD 1200Textiles in situ. Their Find Spots in Egypt and Neighbouring Countries in the First Millenium CETheTextile Museum JournalMartiniani-Reber (Marielle), , Inventaire des collections publiques françaises, 30, Paris, 1986, n° 68, p. 87 ; Muthesius (Anna), , Vienne, 1997, M1314, p. 242 ; De Moor (Antoine), Schrenk (Sabine) et Verhecken-Lammens (Chris), « New Research on the So-called Akhmîm Silks », , Riggisberger Berichte, 13, Riggisberg, 2006, p. 88 ; Winnik (Arielle), \"Toward a Grammar of Textiles: A Reconsideration of Medieval Silk Aesthetics and the Impact of Modern Collecting\",  , 2017, note 74, p. 23"@fr ;
        ecrm:P129_is_about  <http://data.silknow.org/object/eec2be8c-d124-38c1-bc9f-3858e399d859> ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/information/bibliography> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Lyon, musée historique des Tissus. Soieries sassanides, coptes et byzantines, Ve-XIe sièclesByzantine Silk Weaving AD 400 to AD 1200Textiles in situ. Their Find Spots in Egypt and Neighbouring Countries in the First Millenium CETheTextile Museum JournalMartiniani-Reber (Marielle), , Inventaire des collections publiques françaises, 30, Paris, 1986, n° 68, p. 87 ; Muthesius (Anna), , Vienne, 1997, M1314, p. 242 ; De Moor (Antoine), Schrenk (Sabine) et Verhecken-Lammens (Chris), « New Research on the So-called Akhmîm Silks », , Riggisberger Berichte, 13, Riggisberg, 2006, p. 88 ; Winnik (Arielle), \"Toward a Grammar of Textiles: A Reconsideration of Medieval Silk Aesthetics and the Impact of Modern Collecting\",  , 2017, note 74, p. 23"@fr .

